<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Tarish mark for a DARK ground, from the brand kit's logo/mark.svg. See
  res/drawable/ic_mark.xml for why there are two.

  ONE DEVIATION FROM THAT FILE, DELIBERATELY. mark.svg fills the fold with url(#tf) and its
  defs define only tp and tw - the tf gradient is missing, so a conforming renderer paints
  that fold black or not at all. The kit's app-icon/ic_launcher_foreground.svg defines the
  same gradient properly, so its values are used here: #B6AD9B to #9C9280. Worth reporting
  upstream rather than carrying quietly.
-->
